  <section class="section section-soft stripe-top" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title" id="intro-title">What are window graphics?</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Self-adhesive vinyl on glass &mdash; storefront windows, office facades, entrance doors, meeting room partitions. Visible, durable and always bespoke.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:var(--space-9); align-items:start;">
        <div>
          <p>The purpose varies by location: a shop wants to display its name and opening hours, an office wants privacy without losing daylight, a restaurant wants to communicate its menu or atmosphere, a law firm wants a discreet, dignified appearance. Window graphics are usually the first signage element a new business installs in Rotterdam &mdash; and therefore the longest-lasting calling card. A well-installed storefront stays presentable for five to seven years; a poorly installed one fades within a season.</p>
          <p>We have been working with Rotterdam SMEs since 2012. No sales pitch, no multi-week quotation cycles. Send a photograph over WhatsApp, receive a digital mockup within two days, installation carried out at your location by the owner in person.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>Four main film types cover almost every brief:</p>
          <ul style="list-style:disc; padding-left:var(--space-5); color:var(--ink-muted); line-height:var(--lh-base); margin-top:var(--space-3);">
            <li style="margin-bottom:var(--space-3);"><strong style="color:var(--ink);">Cut vinyl (colour film)</strong> &mdash; for logos, lettering and opening hours in solid colour. Available in hundreds of RAL and brand-specific shades, UV-stable for five to seven years outdoors.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom:var(--space-3);"><strong style="color:var(--ink);">Frosted or etched-glass film</strong> &mdash; sandblasted effect that lets light through but blocks visibility. Ideal for meeting rooms, consulting rooms and law firms.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom:var(--space-3);"><strong style="color:var(--ink);">Full-colour print film</strong> &mdash; for photographs, gradients and complex designs, printed with UV inks and laminated.</li>
            <li><strong style="color:var(--ink);">One-way vision (perforated film)</strong> &mdash; a full image from outside, see-through from inside. Ideal for large retail storefronts.</li>
          </ul>
          <p style="margin-top:var(--space-4);">For each type we apply the same standard: A-brand vinyl with laminate, installation by the owner, two-year warranty. Cheap vinyl ordered online fades or peels within a season; the difference lies not in the design but in the material and application method.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

