        <p class="section-subtitle">Rotterdam consists of dozens of neighbourhoods, each with its own mix of retail, hospitality, professional services and healthcare.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-grid" role="list">
        <div class="card" role="listitem">
          <h3 class="card__title">City Centre &amp; Cool</h3>
          <p class="card__body">Shopping streets such as Lijnbaan and Beurstraverse call for clear, eye-catching storefront graphics. High footfall and frequent seasonal promotions. Permit applications go through the welstandscommissie; we know the process and provide the technical documentation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" role="listitem">
          <h3 class="card__title">Kralingen-Crooswijk</h3>
          <p class="card__body">Boutiques, specialty shops and hospitality venues demand refined storefront lettering. Healthcare practices and law firms in this area choose frosted film for privacy combined with daylight.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" role="listitem">
          <h3 class="card__title">Hillegersberg-Schiebroek</h3>
          <p class="card__body">Premium residential neighbourhood with offices for accountancy, notaries and financial services. Demand for classic gilded frosted film and cast vinyl in restrained colours. High quality expectations, understated appearance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" role="listitem">
          <h3 class="card__title">Feijenoord &amp; Katendrecht</h3>
          <p class="card__body">Hospitality corridor with cocktail bars, delis and restaurants that use the storefront as brand communication. Full-colour print and cut vinyl for atmosphere and taste identity. Evening legibility is a requirement.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" role="listitem">
          <h3 class="card__title">Charlois &amp; IJsselmonde</h3>
          <p class="card__body">Retail zones with hair salons, physiotherapy practices and small specialty shops. Practical packages with logo, opening hours and services on the storefront. Reliable, affordable quality is the key criterion.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" role="listitem">
          <h3 class="card__title">Prins Alexander</h3>
          <p class="card__body">Business park and professional services: IT companies, consultancies, administrative offices. Logo on office facade, frosted film for meeting room privacy, door numbers and internal wayfinding.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" role="listitem">
          <h3 class="card__title">Delfshaven</h3>
          <p class="card__body">Historic shop premises with protected-monument status. Storefronts in small, atmospheric pands require materials and installation techniques that do not damage the glass or frames. Experience with heritage requirements is essential.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" role="listitem">
          <h3 class="card__title">Hoogvliet &amp; Pernis</h3>
          <p class="card__body">Small independent businesses with a local customer base. Practical starter packages, clear business names and opening hours. Short lead time and honest pricing are the most important criteria here.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

