          <p>On all window graphics our standard two-year warranty applies on colour stability, adhesion and material defects. If an issue arises within that period we return free of charge to remedy it.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <ul style="list-style:none; padding:0;">
            <li style="padding:var(--space-4) 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);">
