              <span style="color:var(--ink-muted); font-size:var(--text-sm);">Industry standard for signage vinyl. 3M Controltac and IJ-series for interior and exterior use, UV-stable colours and seven-year manufacturer warranty.</span>
            </li>
            <li style="padding:var(--space-4) 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);">
              <strong style="display:block; margin-bottom:var(--space-1);">Avery Dennison</strong>
              <span style="color:var(--ink-muted); font-size:var(--text-sm);">Premium office and retail vinyl. Avery MPI and SC-series with strong adhesion and stable colour reproduction. Widely used for frosted film and privacy applications.</span>
            </li>
