  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
    <div class="container--narrow">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">Frequently asked questions</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="faq-title">FAQ &mdash; window graphics Rotterdam</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq" role="list">
        <div class="faq__item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-en-1">What do window graphics cost in Rotterdam?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
          <div class="faq__answer" id="faq-en-1" role="region" hidden><p>We work with four transparent packages. Starter (small shop, lettering and logo on one window) from &euro;149. Shop complete (storefront, opening hours, logo on all windows) from &euro;249. Hospitality pack (menu or promotions plus logo plus privacy frosted film) from &euro;449. Custom (large project, full-colour print, complex design) from &euro;749. All prices include VAT, design, A-brand vinyl and on-site installation.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-en-2">How long do window graphics last?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
          <div class="faq__answer" id="faq-en-2" role="region" hidden><p>Professional window graphics with A-brand vinyl from 3M, Avery Dennison, Hexis or Orafol typically last five to seven years outdoors in the Dutch climate. Interior applications often last ten years or more. Our standard warranty is two years on colour stability and adhesion; in practice our work outlasts the warranty by several years. We have window graphics from 2015 that are still perfect.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-en-3">Which types of window film can you supply?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
          <div class="faq__answer" id="faq-en-3" role="region" hidden><p>Four main types: cut vinyl (coloured vinyl for logos, lettering and opening hours), frosted or etched-glass film (sandblasted effect for privacy and light transmission, ideal for offices and law firms), full-colour print film (for photographs, gradients and complex designs) and one-way vision (perforated film: full image from outside, see-through from inside, ideal for storefronts). We advise on the best film type per project.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-en-4">Can you install frosted privacy film?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
          <div class="faq__answer" id="faq-en-4" role="region" hidden><p>Yes. Frosted film gives a sandblasted effect that lets light through but blocks outside visibility. Widely used on office and law-firm windows, meeting rooms and treatment rooms in healthcare. We install it as full coverage or in patterns with logo cut-outs. The film is removable without damage to the glass.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-en-5">How long does a project take from quote to installation?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
          <div class="faq__answer" id="faq-en-5" role="region" hidden><p>Standard timeline: WhatsApp contact same day, mockup within 48 hours, three to four working days for production and installation after approval. A complete shop or office project is typically ready within a week. Rush jobs can be accommodated; for seasonal clients such as hospitality and retail we also work evenings and weekends at no surcharge.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-en-6">Can window film be removed cleanly?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
          <div class="faq__answer" id="faq-en-6" role="region" hidden><p>Yes. A-brand vinyl from 3M, Avery, Hexis or Orafol removes cleanly from glass even after years. We remove old window graphics as part of a new project or as a stand-alone service. For adhesive residue we use professional citrus-based removers that do not damage glass or window frames.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-en-7">Do you work outside Rotterdam?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
          <div class="faq__answer" id="faq-en-7" role="region" hidden><p>Yes. In addition to Rotterdam we work throughout the region: Schiedam, Vlaardingen, Capelle aan den IJssel, Barendrecht, Spijkenisse, Ridderkerk, Krimpen aan den IJssel and Maassluis. No travel charge within these towns. For projects further afield in Zuid-Holland we can also travel; we agree any transport costs in advance.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-en-8">Can I supply my own design? What file format?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
          <div class="faq__answer" id="faq-en-8" role="region" hidden><p>Yes, that saves you design fees. Supply vector files: .ai (Adobe Illustrator), .eps, outlined .pdf or .svg. Raster formats such as .jpg or .png are only usable at very high resolution and for full-colour print work. If you only have a JPG logo, we can usually vectorise simple marks at no extra charge.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-en-9">My window has a curved or unusual shape. Is that possible?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
          <div class="faq__answer" id="faq-en-9" role="region" hidden><p>Yes. We measure the glass on location beforehand, or you send photos with dimensions via WhatsApp. Cut vinyl and frosted film can be cut to size for round, oval, angled or irregular windows. For complex shapes we produce a template drawing that you approve before production.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-en-10">How do I clean window graphics?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
          <div class="faq__answer" id="faq-en-10" role="region" hidden><p>Clean with lukewarm water and a mild detergent or glass cleaner and a soft microfibre cloth. Avoid abrasive sponges, scouring agents, aggressive solvents and high-pressure washers. Regular cleaning of the exterior of storefronts not only looks better but also extends the service life of the vinyl.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-en-11">Do you install in the evening or at weekends?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
          <div class="faq__answer" id="faq-en-11" role="region" hidden><p>Yes, at no surcharge. For shops and hospitality venues that cannot close during the day we install on Saturday or in the evening. WhatsApp is also broadly accessible; typically within an hour on weekday evenings until 21:00 and on Saturdays.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-en-12">How many years of warranty and what does it cover?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
          <div class="faq__answer" id="faq-en-12" role="region" hidden><p>Two years on colour stability, adhesion and material defects. If the film detaches within that period due to a production defect, fades faster than promised, or shows material failures, we return free of charge to remedy it. The warranty does not cover damage by third parties, accidents or deliberate damage.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

